concept:australian-federal-police-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2004-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Schedule 1,"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "item 8 The later of: (a) immediately after the commencement of the provision(s) covered by table item 2; and (b) the time Schedule 1 to the Non-Proliferation Legislation Amendment Act 2003 commences. However, the provision(s) do not commence at all if the event mentioned in paragraph (b) does not occur." ;
