concept:australian-federal-police-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2004-sch-1-sec-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 Subsection 4(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-5 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: ordinary search means a search of a person or of articles in the possession of a person that may include:  (a) requiring the person to remove his or her overcoat, coat or jacket and any gloves, shoes and hat; and  (b) an examination of those items." ;
