doc:sch-1-sec-14j-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "14J(5) Stopping and searching" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) An action or proceeding, whether civil or criminal, does not lie against a person who conducts a search under paragraph (3)(b) or (c) if the person acts in good faith and does not contravene subsection (6).  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979" ;
