concept:australian-federal-police-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2004-sch-1-sec-40ec a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40EC Special protective service officers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-40ec ;
    values:originalText "The Commissioner may, on such terms and conditions as the Commissioner determines in writing, appoint a person as a special protective service officer of the Australian Federal Police to assist in performing the protective service functions of the Australian Federal Police." ;
    skos:definition "The Commissioner may, on such terms and conditions as the Commissioner determines in writing, appoint a person as a special protective service officer of the Australian Federal Police to assist in performing the protective service functions of the Australian Federal Police."@en ;
