concept:australian-federal-police-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2004-sch-1-sec-30-2-ss-4c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30(4C) Australian Federal Police and Other Legislation Amendment Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-30-2-ss-4c ;
    values:originalText "(4C) The Commissioner may, by writing signed by the Commissioner, certify that a specified person:  (a) is, or is not, a protective service officer or a special protective service officer; or  (b) was, or was not, on a specified day, or during a specified period, a protective service officer or a special protective service officer." ;
    skos:definition "(4C) The Commissioner may, by writing signed by the Commissioner, certify that a specified person:  (a) is, or is not, a protective service officer or a special protective service officer; or  (b) was, or was not, on a specified day, or during a specified period, a protective service officer or a special protective service officer."@en ;
