doc:sch-1-sec-68a-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "68A(3) Certificates in relation to transferred PSOs" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Commissioner may also certify either or both of the following in relation to the person:  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979  Schedule 1  Australian Federal Police and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2004  (a) that the person made and subscribed an oath or affirmation under section 10 of the Australian Protective Service Act 1987;  (b) that the person is, on the date on which the certificate is signed, a protective service officer and has been such a protective service officer continuously since being appointed under section 9 of the Australian Protective Service Act 1987." ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-federal-police-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2004-sch-1-sec-68a-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "68A(4) Certificates in relation to transferred PSOs"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-68a-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Unless the contrary is proved, a document purporting to be a certificate given under this section is taken to be such a certificate and to have been duly given." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Unless the contrary is proved, a document purporting to be a certificate given under this section is taken to be such a certificate and to have been duly given."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dd9558ba9b32f74505d2fc956b370a700235529e1d62cdae4e1df3ce11ab57b8" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-federal-police-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2004-sch-1-sec-68a ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Document purporting to be a certificate is taken to be valid unless proven otherwise." ;
