concept:australian-federal-police-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2004-sch-3-sec-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Subsection 3(1) (paragraph (a) of the definition of thing"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "relevant to an indictable offence) Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (a) either of the following:  Amendments relating to the investigation of State offences that have a federal aspect Schedule 3  Australian Federal Police and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2004  (i) anything with respect to which an indictable offence against any law of the Commonwealth or of a Territory has been committed or is suspected, on reasonable grounds, to have been committed;  (ii) anything with respect to which a State offence that has a federal aspect, and that is an indictable offence against the law of that State, has been committed or is suspected, on reasonable grounds, to have been committed; or" ;
    skos:definition "relevant to an indictable offence) Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (a) either of the following:  Amendments relating to the investigation of State offences that have a federal aspect Schedule 3  Australian Federal Police and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2004  (i) anything with respect to which an indictable offence against any law of the Commonwealth or of a Territory has been committed or is suspected, on reasonable grounds, to have been committed;  (ii) anything with respect to which a State offence that has a federal aspect, and that is an indictable offence against the law of that State, has been committed or is suspected, on reasonable grounds, to have been committed; or"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "95cdec603c144c399e51b5cd2deb2f72949a216614ee2ff3b9485b1cb2c9b821" ;
    cof:pageNumber "44"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Repeal and substitute paragraph (a) of the definition of thing relevant to an indictable offence with amendments relating to investigation of State offences that have a federal aspect." ;
