concept:australian-federal-police-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2004-sch-3-sec-46 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "46 Australian Federal Police and Other Legislation Amendment Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-46 ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of this Part, serious State offence that has a federal aspect means a State offence that has a federal aspect and that has the characteristics of a serious Commonwealth offence. Note: The heading to section 15HB is replaced by the heading “What is a serious Commonwealth offence or a serious State offence that has a federal aspect?”." ;
    skos:definition "(2) For the purposes of this Part, serious State offence that has a federal aspect means a State offence that has a federal aspect and that has the characteristics of a serious Commonwealth offence. Note: The heading to section 15HB is replaced by the heading “What is a serious Commonwealth offence or a serious State offence that has a federal aspect?”."@en ;
